{"id":"17b3325184317072","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-binary-universal-machine.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine","display":"thm-universal-turing-machine — Universal Turing Machine","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-binary-universal-machine","aliases":["73-thm-binary-universal-machine","73-thm-universal-turing-machine"],"display":"thm-universal-turing-machine — Universal Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-binary-universal-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-binary-universal-machine</span><span>73-thm-universal-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-turing-machine — Universal Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" href=\"?note=b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" title=\"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting\">73-df-binary-diagonal-halting</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed effective machine and pair coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M\\)</span> (machine semantics)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\,\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\,\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n\\Biggl(\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Accept}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Reject}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Halts}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\,\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\,\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n\\Biggl(\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Accept}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Reject}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Halts}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>One fixed interpreter decodes a finite transition table and simulates its configurations step by step. The same interpreter witnesses all three displays; determinism preserves acceptance, rejection, and divergence.</li>\n<li>The former equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)=M(w)\">\\(U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)=M(w)\\)</span> lacked both an encoding and a partial-computation semantics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting","status":"resolved","id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed effective machine and pair coding, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\,\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\,\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n\\Biggl(\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Accept}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Reject}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Halts}_U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E})\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\n\\Bigr]\n\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)=M(w)","display":false}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd777d11b311e27a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6a57904f836e3e9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["db96cabedd089e5f","888d8ab66ec7efca","b9e8acd6d8438a5d"]}